            "created_at": "2025-08-27T16:50:34.65763+00:00",
            "notes": "Round 3 is the round that we fully pivot to the build, the best advice from this round to the rest of the game is to spam as many repair packs as you can as often as you can and to get into their tank and dps' face brawl!\n\n[Optimizer](item_13d41c37-8f79-4435-9d81-c9599955f6a8) is the power we are going to be completely focused around, this power gives you 5% max life per second with EACH repair pack active, so by giving three teammates a repair pack you generate 15% max life per second!! Using this in tandem with [Packstacker](item_87b99cde-3089-42fd-86bc-6e1ebf3fe422) allows us to extend the repair packs duration and draw out the healing as long as we can.\n\nThe items we will be taking are: [Gloomgauntlet](item_76cb8fe3-3c1f-4769-a1ec-a9c2dc510ba7) and [Nullifier Neuroworks](item_6501be99-b951-4dad-9bb5-8305eb17d84e), Gloomgauntlet will give us even more healing making us even more tankier, and Nullifier Neuroworks makes spamming repair packs easier than ever.\n\n[Nullifier Neuroworks](item_6501be99-b951-4dad-9bb5-8305eb17d84e) is the more important of the two so make sure you have that if you are lacking in money, and build as much [Attack Speed](stat_attack_speed) as you can with whatever is left over.",
