            "notes": "You can choose between [Aura Farming](item_b2416f42-1aa6-440a-8080-86290f5556c0) and [Burst Aid](item_a676ca4f-264e-46b1-8a4a-9aa732b95eae) depending on your situation in the game. \n\nIf you feel like you need to invest 100% in yourself to carry, take [Burst Aid](item_a676ca4f-264e-46b1-8a4a-9aa732b95eae). This will allow you to pretty much full heal yourself if you have the packs to afford it, though I would use this only when you need it and try to play around [Optimizer](item_13d41c37-8f79-4435-9d81-c9599955f6a8) as much as you can.\n\nIf you want to play around your team a lot and provide even more support [Aura Farming](item_b2416f42-1aa6-440a-8080-86290f5556c0) is amazing here aswell, you'll be able to offer a pretty consistent source of overhealth and when combined with [Mitzi's Medicine](item_382d3dbd-63b8-453f-9be3-fefc3600dd24) it will be a great source of additional sustain.\n\n[Scavenged Steel](item_fb9d2d13-db05-46fa-b3c6-07495b1872a4) is an amazing item to take here, with this you will farm rally so incredibly fast and be able to swing fights with little to no effort.\n\nAside from this choose any optional items provided and swap around to whatever suits you best, good luck on this round and I hope you enjoyed this build as much as I did!",
